<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Now then... it's 10 p.m. <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE>, time to get ready."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Are you going somewhere?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I become a witch tonight. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A witch is something like the settlement's priest."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s face no longer showed any trace of the drink.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Her expression was serious, like a knight heading for the battlefield.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, when I asked you to come with me earlier, it was because I want you to watch that succession rite."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... In the Arata settlement, a grown woman who has lost her mother performs the rite of becoming a witch on the day before the next memorial service."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, it's a good chance, let's get them to show us! An outsider getting to watch has gotta be a first since the Arata settlement began! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you're coming too, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Is it that big a rite? Is it really okay...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Uh... Why are we being allowed to watch? Even if we're here because </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> introduced us..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Curious?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Erika-chan<STYLE ID="3"> smiled as she began to speak.</STYLE><PG>
"That's because... it's <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> I want watching it. 
{PAUSE ""}
And the one who trusts that <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Erina-chan</STYLE>, as well."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Because it's me? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Why me? Even if I'm friends with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE><PG>
"I'll tell you that after the rite is over. 
{PAUSE ""}
It has a little to do with the curse I told you about earlier."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">With that, </STYLE>Erika-chan<STYLE ID="3"> left the living room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... The footing is bad on the way to the graveyard, so be very careful."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"The graveyard?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... It's held in the settlement's graveyard clearing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There are no streetlights either, so the moonlight is all we have to go by."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I hate to say it, but a graveyard right after a ghost story is a little creepy.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, what about </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\そよかぜ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was nodding off sleepily.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> seriously need to go to bed now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6"><TXSPS>"Nnyaah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Don't wanna..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... If </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s going... I'm going..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>"Ehh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">At this rate, she's probably planning to cling to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> all over again.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
